      "extract": "2 1. DQS options: overview The DQS toolbox proposes several options to assess different aspects of the monitoring system at different levels. Table 1. Description of the main areas a DQS can assess Option District Health Unit Main measures Assess reporting accuracy X X Accuracy ratio Assess recording accuracy X Accuracy ratio (sample in the community) Assess completeness/ X X Completeness of district reporting (%)",
