        }
      ],
      "extract": "WHO/IVB/05.04 Ideally a DQS should be introduced in a country and conducted on an ongoing basis. In a district though, the number of sites to be visited is constrained by the desired precision and logistic issues, such as time available, the number of team members, distances, ease of travel, the ability to obtain security clearance in difficult areas, and the availability of vehicles, drivers and accommodation. A",
