      "extract": "30 The data quality assessment provides a certain amount of information on the status of records and practices related to the reporting system. All options in the DQS toolbox provide quantitative measures which can be followed easily over time and used to compare different areas. The use of the tool will be particularly interesting when several districts can be compared or a district can be compared to itself over",
