      ],
      "extract": "34 The suggested approach is to introduce the DQS in a country through a national workshop, followed immediately by an assessment in a number of districts and HUs. The workshop aims: • to sensitize key health personnel on the importance of accurately monitoring immunization activities and data quality; • to train key health personnel from the national and district levels in data quality self-assessment methodology",
      "extractCut": true
