      "extract": "WHO/IVB/05.04 The key to DQS success depends on the success of the workshop and first assessment. A well-focused assessment should result in the following. • A documented monitoring system: The tool should help managers to estimate whether the information collected is reliable (accurate), and whether the information is properly used (the monitoring system is of good quality). • Identified weaknesses and strengths of",
